    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p>You might wonder: “Do sunflower seeds go bad?” The answer is yes—they do. But the process is not as simple as it sounds. In this blog, you’ll discover the various types of spoilage, the environmental causes behind them, how key nutritional components change over time, the risks associated with different spoilage levels, and, most importantly, how you can properly store your sunflower seeds to retain their quality and safety.</p><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">Table of Contents</p>
